Agent Responsibilities
Agent	Responsibility	Scoring Scale
Evaluation Orchestrator	Coordinates the pipeline: receives input, triggers retrieval, dispatches to judge agents, collects results, invokes verdict module	—
Relevance Judge Agent	Checks whether the AI response actually addresses the question asked	1–5
Accuracy Judge Agent	Checks factual correctness of the response against reference answer/retrieved evidence	1–5
Hallucination Detection Agent	Flags claims in the response not supported by the retrieved context/reference (faithfulness check)	1–5 (or hallucination % )
Completeness Judge Agent	Checks whether the response covers all necessary parts of the question	1–5
Verdict Agent	Aggregates the four scores (weighted or averaged) into a final pass/fail + confidence verdict	Composite
